                    <chunk name="param_output" index="8">
                      <items count="7">
                        <item name="Access" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">1</item>
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Tree crowns from the cloud's own vegetation returns (classes 3-5; unclassified points beside buildings when the cloud has a building class), one closed mesh per cluster of 4 m columns from 0.41 x tree height to the top, none inside a footprint. Plug into the Tree component's Geometry, one Tree per crown. Empty when the cloud has no vegetation, and not rebuilt from the cache: press Re-run.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">c8264084-5088-4998-a4ea-26190b24bb4a</item>
                        <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Tree Crowns</item>
